2. Scripts that import GKFlasher: GPL-3.0-or-later

   tools/raw_logger.py, tools/ram_logger.py and roms/tunes/paddock-pops/build.py
   import modules from GKFlasher (https://github.com/Dante383/GKFlasher,
   GPL-3.0). They are licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3
   or (at your option) any later version. Full text:
   https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt

3. TunerPro definitions: Apache-2.0

   defs/ and backups/ca654019 2700.xdf. The upstream "ca654019 2700.xdf" is
   from OpenGK-org/opengk-simk (Apache-2.0). "ca654019 2700 extended.xdf" is a
   derivative of it. "ca654019 2700 code-derived.xdf" is original work, licensed
   the same way so the set stays consistent with upstream. Full text:
   https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

4. Mirrored reference material: upstream terms only

   reference/opengk-simk/     OpenGK-org/opengk-simk, Apache-2.0.
