5. ECU firmware and calibration data: not licensed

   roms/ (stock dumps, tune images, readbacks) and the .bin files under
   backups/ contain Siemens and Hyundai firmware and calibration data. The
   copyright in that material remains with its owners. It is included so that
   the analysis and patches can be reproduced on a matching vehicle; no license
   is granted or implied, and the disclaimer in section 1 applies to any use.
